      "sha256": "a89fe618fc2a96829bea9472b6a254769b419e87cb228a970f55263483737bba",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 5b. Top-down apartment layout created by P10 without generative AI. Two bedrooms appear above a living and dining area with an L-shaped sofa on the left and a rectangular dining table and chairs in the center. The bedrooms use a coordinated pale furniture palette."
    },
    {
