      "sha256": "1ef2aeb79ece45912f84c560b5e0c779140b38757de10be75c33fde8d6e4dbf7",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 5c. P6 used generative AI for the two bedrooms and created the remainder of the apartment without AI. Both upper bedrooms are densely furnished. The lower living area contains a sofa and two round tables with a broad open space to the right."
    },
    {
      "path": "figures/zhang-vrcopilot-uist2024/figure-008-p008.png",
